# Portfolio Restructuring Skill

## Purpose
Analyze portfolio holdings to identify:
- Overvalued positions
- Concentration risks
- Better allocation opportunities
- Sell candidates with risk/reward imbalance
- Rebalancing recommendations

## Input Context
- Portfolio holdings from CSV imports
- Current market prices
- Sector classifications
- Valuation metrics (P/E, P/B, EV/EBITDA)
- Risk metrics (beta, volatility)

## Output Format
Markdown sections:
### 📊 Portfolio Analysis
- Current allocation by sector/asset class
- Concentration risk assessment
- Valuation comparison vs sector averages

### 🔍 Overvalued Positions
- List of positions with valuation metrics > sector average by X%
- Reasoning for overvaluation
- Suggested action (sell/hold/rotate)

### 🔄 Rebalancing Recommendations
- Underweight sectors needing exposure
- Suggested new positions with rationale
- Portfolio weight targets

### ⚠️ Risk Alerts
- Regulatory risks
- Balance sheet concerns
- Technical indicators suggesting downtrend

## Usage
Include this skill when:
- Generating investment ideas
- Updating recommendations
- Analyzing portfolio performance
- Creating market sentiment analysis

## Integration
Call via LLM prompt template:
"Analyze portfolio restructuring using the Portfolio Restructuring Skill with context: {portfolio_context}"